{"id":"c2340bb7-eb0a-4212-9518-e29abf2936f1","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:59:44.831Z","batchId":"onboarding_minimax-m3-1-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"onboarding-title\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Step 1 of 3</span>\n        <h1 id=\"onboarding-title\">Create your account</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Start by setting up your sign-in details. You can review your preferences next.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" aria-label=\"Onboarding progress\">\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <strong>Account</strong>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">Your sign-in details</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"badge\">In progress</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"progress\" aria-label=\"Step 1 of 3, 33 percent complete\"><div style=\"width:33%\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"row between small muted\">\n          <span>1. Account</span>\n          <span>2. Preferences</span>\n          <span>3. Done</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr>\n\n      <form id=\"onboarding-form\" class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label for=\"name\">Full name\n            <input id=\"name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"e.g. Jordan Lee\" required>\n          </label>\n          <label for=\"email\">Email address\n            <input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <label for=\"password\">Create a password\n          <input id=\"password\" name=\"password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"8\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" required>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Use 8 or more characters with a mix of letters and numbers.</span>\n        </label>\n\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"terms\" required>\n          <span>I agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.</span>\n        </label>\n\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\">\n          <button id=\"back-button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\" disabled>Back</button>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <button id=\"next-button\" class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Next: Preferences</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n\n      <div id=\"preferences-step\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2>Choose your preferences</h2>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Tell us how you would like to receive updates and what matters most to you.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <fieldset class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <legend class=\"h3\">Email frequency</legend>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"daily\" checked> <span>Daily updates</span></label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"weekly\"> <span>Weekly digest</span></label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"never\"> <span>Only important announcements</span></label>\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <label for=\"timezone\">Time zone\n          <select id=\"timezone\" name=\"timezone\">\n            <option>Pacific Time (PT)</option>\n            <option>Mountain Time (MT)</option>\n            <option>Central Time (CT)</option>\n            <option>Eastern Time (ET)</option>\n            <option>Greenwich Mean Time (GMT)</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\">\n          <button id=\"preferences-back\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\">Back</button>\n          <button id=\"finish-button\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">Finish setup</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"done-step\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Step 3 of 3</span>\n          <h2>You're all set</h2>\n          <p class=\"lead\">Your account has been created and your preferences are saved.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"alert\">\n          <strong>Welcome aboard.</strong>\n          <span>You can now sign in and start using your account.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button id=\"done-back\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\">Back</button>\n          <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">Go to dashboard</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    const accountStep = document.getElementById('onboarding-form');\n    const preferencesStep = document.getElementById('preferences-step');\n    const doneStep = document.getElementById('done-step');\n    const nextButton = document.getElementById('next-button');\n    const backButton = document.getElementById('back-button');\n    const preferencesBack = document.getElementById('preferences-back');\n    const finishButton = document.getElementById('finish-button');\n    const doneBack = document.getElementById('done-back');\n\n    function showStep(step) {\n      accountStep.hidden = step !== 1;\n      preferencesStep.hidden = step !== 2;\n      doneStep.hidden = step !== 3;\n      backButton.disabled = step === 1;\n    }\n\n    nextButton.addEventListener('click', function (event) {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      if (accountStep.reportValidity()) showStep(2);\n    });\n\n    backButton.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      showStep(1);\n    });\n\n    preferencesBack.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      showStep(1);\n    });\n\n    finishButton.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      showStep(3);\n    });\n\n    doneBack.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      showStep(2);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[11547,"<main"],[11574," class=\"page\">\n  <section"],[11602," class=\"card\""],[11647," aria-labelledby=\""],[11648,"onboarding-title\">\n    <div class"],[11994,"=\"stack gap-lg"],[12008,"\">\n      <div class=\"stack"],[12058," gap"],[12084,"-sm\">\n        <span"],[12118," class=\"badge"],[12122," badge-outline"],[12152,"\">Step"],[12170," 1 of"],[12197," 3</span>\n        <h"],[12218,"1 id=\"onboarding-title\">Create"],[12244," your account</h1>\n        "],[12271,"<p class=\"lead\">Start"],[12300," by"],[12596," setting up your sign"],[12629,"-in details. You"],[12664," can review"],[12690," your"],[12698," preferences next"],[12719,".</p>\n      </div>\n\n     "],[12744," <div class=\"stack"],[12768," gap-sm\""],[12793," aria-label=\"Onboarding progress"],[12817,"\">\n        <div class=\"row"],[12841," between\">\n          <div class=\"stack"],[12865," gap-sm\">\n            <strong>Account"],[12896,"</strong>\n            <span class=\""],[12914,"small muted"],[12937,"\">Your"],[12993," sign"],[12993,"-in details</span>\n          </div"],[13043,">\n          <span class=\"badge\">"],[13043,"In"],[13066," progress</span>\n        </div>\n"],[13100,"        <div class=\"progress\" aria"],[13114,"-label=\"Step"],[13150," 1